{"availability":"available","full":"dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor","name":"branching-story-editor","description":"Co-write branching interactive fiction with AI: a live story graph, continuity checks, play mode and Twine export.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T04:17:27Z","updated":"2026-10-10T03:50:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/branching-story-editor/","topics":["github-pages","graph","interactive-fiction","javascript","twine"],"demo":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/branching-story-editor/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.316Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.316Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.316Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.316Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Co-write branching interactive fiction with AI: a live story graph, continuity checks, play mode and Twine export.","Story Weaver is a small interactive-fiction studio. Give it a premise and genre and the AI writes an opening passage with choices. Every unwritten choice appears in the graph as an orange '+'. Click one and the AI writes that branch, using the path that led there (earlier titles plus the most recent full passages) so characters and facts stay consistent. You can edit anything, wire choices to existing passages to merge branches, mark endings, rewrite passages in a different tone, and run an AI continuity check along any path. Stats flag dead ends and unreachable passages. Play mode reads it…"],"features":["Layered graph layout (BFS depth) with curved edges, pan/zoom, and '+' stubs for unwritten choices","AI branch writing with path-aware context; nudges toward endings as paths deepen","Passage editor: title, text, endings, choices wired to new or existing passages (merge branches)","AI suggest-choices and rewrite-in-tone (more vivid, darker, funnier, shorter, more dialogue)","AI continuity check along the path to any passage"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3e2fedc6819292e301862cd7401303f637ce31851280caf02b30defc91bfc4b7","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.403Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.403Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Co-write branching interactive fiction with AI: a live story graph, continuity checks, play mode and Twine export.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"index.html is the public home page, login.html handles accounts and app.html is the app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3e2fedc6819292e301862cd7401303f637ce31851280caf02b30defc91bfc4b7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.403Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T03:50:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/branching-story-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.404Z","hash":"3e2fedc6819292e301862cd7401303f637ce31851280caf02b30defc91bfc4b7","originalBytes":5733,"storedBytes":5733,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["src","page","graph","passages","app","browser","choices","every","lib","mode","play","tests","endings","json","path","settings","story","twee","variables","any","continuity","passage","runs","twine","accounts","branch","core.js","export","functions","generated","index.html","key","live","logic","model","only","open","provider","styles","unit","unreachable","unwritten","when","along","analysis","app.html","back","bash","bfs","box","branches","branching-story-editor","build","calls","check","choice","context","covered","dead","dom","editor","ends","existing","gam